OL,3,AUK sanctions firms over Israeli West
OL,4,ABank settlements
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK has sanctioned companies it said
OL,7,Fwere involved in building settlements
OL,8,Fin the occupied West Bank, in the first
OL,9,Fpackage of measures since the
OL,10,Fgovernment announced a tougher approach
OL,11,Fto Israeli actions in the territory.
OL,13,FThe government said the sanctions
OL,14,Fagainst eight construction and property
OL,15,Fdevelopment firms would disrupt their
OL,16,Fflows of finance and ability to support
OL,17,Fbuilding in the West Bank.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
