OL,3,AMajor report proposes welfare changes,
OL,4,Aapprenticeships and tax cuts to help
OL,5,A440,000 young people into work
OL,6,
OL,7,FA major review into UK youth
OL,8,Funemployment has been published,
OL,9,Fproposing widespread changes to tax,
OL,10,Fwelfare, and education - here's an
OL,11,Foverview
OL,13,FIn the government-backed report,
OL,14,FMilburn says making his changes could
OL,15,Fhelp 440,000 young people into work by
OL,16,F2036
OL,18,FAlmost one million people aged 16 to 24
OL,19,Fare not in education, employment or
OL,20,Ftraining - a rate of 13%, which Milburn
OL,21,Fwants to fall to 5% within a decade
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
