OL,3,AMajor report proposes welfare changes,
OL,4,Aapprenticeships and tax cuts to help
OL,5,A440,000 young people into work
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe proposes that under-25s should no
OL,8,Flonger be able to claim the health
OL,9,Felement of universal credit; businesses
OL,10,Fshould be taxed less for employing
OL,11,Fyoung people; and public and private
OL,12,Fsector employers should hire more
OL,13,Fapprentices
OL,15,FEarlier, he said his proposed changes
OL,16,Fare not about saving money - although
OL,17,Fthe report says there could be overall
OL,18,Fsavings of #200m a year by 2036
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
