OL,3,ATrump meets Modi and other world
OL,4,Aleaders in Philippines on first leg of
OL,5,AAsia trip
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump is in the Philippines on
OL,8,Fthe first leg of a high-profile trip to
OL,9,FAsia - images show the US president
OL,10,Fmeeting India's Narendra Modi,
OL,11,FAustralia's Anthony Albanese and
OL,12,FJapan's Sanae Takaichi
OL,14,F"We have a great relationship with
OL,15,Fthese people and these countries,"
OL,16,FTrump tells reporters, adding Modi is a
OL,17,F"very tough man" and Takaichi "may be
OL,18,Feven tougher"
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
